a, dell'amicizia e della solidarietà."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Three sisters who grew up unaware of each other receive a mysterious letter one day and meet at the wedding of one of them. But on the wedding night they will find themselves in an unexpected situation. After that night, they cannot leave the beautiful town of the Aegean and are forced to live together. This imperative condition gradually leaves its place to the adventure of discovering brotherhood, friendship and solidarity."},{"language":"tr-TR","overview":"Sevgili Geçmiş dizisinde zengin bir ailenin çocuğu ile evlenen Cahide isimli bir kadının kayını Cemal’in kendisine attığı bir iftira sonucunda kocasını öldürmekle suçlanıp 24 yıl ceza alması ve kendisi hapisteyken yetiştirme yurdunda yetişen üç kızının dram ve aşk dolu hikayesi anlatılacak."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5a01HFYWKEIxYUXCEkRIEFaxOwl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5a01HFYWKEIxYUXCEkRIEFaxOwl.jpg","language":"it","width":1413,"height":2000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l5c7gd1Nwwc6m4LNusOwA93BF6i.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l5c7gd1Nwwc6m4LNusOwA93BF6i.jpg","language":"it","width":1413,"height":2000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Jwnsl1IH0G9D1GF1GK539hOvhn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Jwnsl1IH0G9D1GF1GK539hOvhn.jpg","language":"tr","width":1000,"height":1415},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/okc5mcKfxFpKp1b5XoS68zGO59F.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/okc5mcKfxFpKp1b5XoS68zGO59F.jpg","language":"tr","width":700,"height":1040}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ApjuS9Jwfho38l8NO5KwjCdq8hl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ApjuS9Jwfho38l8NO5KwjCdq8hl.jpg","language":"xx","width":1920,"height":1080}]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/origi